    "device": "Existing actual Device group: pending Window flip without head IRQ, queued Present cancellation, RM audio mute/clear, delayed NULL/Core/Window-FINISHED/ARM stop, retained CPU repaint, same-size fresh upload and different-size automatic mode/old-group retirement. Further HPD interrupts a live query and a mapped source before commit; both restart cleanly.",
    "model_boundary": "Hardware MMIO, firmware replies and CE completion are modeled. This lifecycle case consumes independent completed receiver fixtures; separate existing acquisition/debounce cases exercise the producer.",
    "guest": "Short SMP4 Desktop/window/software-cursor bootfb regression on exact Kernel0.1.165. Previous release label0.79.15 in the accepted image; label updated after validation. No native NVIDIA hardware in QEMU.",
